WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:05.680
This continent knows the true meaning of racism.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:12.039
Its peoples have both been perpetrators of racism

00:00:12.759 --> 00:00:18.800
against others and themselves the victims

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:25.839
of an insane and murderous racist ideology.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:36.800
We understood that we could not end the nightmare

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:42.439
by surrendering ourselves to the passion of hatred

00:00:43.079 --> 00:00:47.119
and the spirit of vengeance and retribution.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.879
We are striving to proceed in a manner

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.039
and towards a result,

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:01.000
which will ensure that all our people,

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.039
both black and white, emerge as victors.

00:01:08.079 --> 00:01:11.800
We recognised President de Klerk

00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.879
and his colleagues in the National Party

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:22.319
as men and women of integrity.

00:01:22.959 --> 00:01:27.159
We are therefore prepared to work with them,

00:01:28.039 --> 00:01:34.159
to arrive at a just and lasting negotiated solution.

00:01:42.079 --> 00:01:46.200
It must result in the transformation of South Africa

00:01:46.920 --> 00:01:54.759
into a united, democratic and non-racial country.

00:01:56.439 --> 00:02:02.400
Anything less than this would condemn our country

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:07.600
to worsening and economic conflict.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.360
Every adult South African

00:02:12.479 --> 00:02:17.119
must have the right to participate

00:02:19.360 --> 00:02:21.519
in governing our country

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:26.879
through a system of one person, one vote.

00:02:29.239 --> 00:02:32.319
The human rights of all our citizens

00:02:33.959 --> 00:02:35.519
must be guaranteed.

00:02:37.319 --> 00:02:41.000
The apartheid system in our country continues.

00:02:42.439 --> 00:02:45.360
We continue to be ruled

00:02:45.839 --> 00:02:48.639
by a white minority government.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:54.159
All the other pillars of the apartheid system

00:02:55.479 --> 00:02:57.600
have not yet been removed.

00:02:59.039 --> 00:03:00.600
The masses of our people

00:03:01.479 --> 00:03:04.280
must therefore continue the struggle

00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:06.560
within our own country.

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:13.319
The international community shares the same obligation.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.759
We thank you most sincerely,

00:03:16.759 --> 00:03:20.639
for awarding us with the Sakharov Prize.

00:03:21.159 --> 00:03:24.639
We take it as a challenge, above all,

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:30.879
to have the courage to fight for justice and peace,

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:33.680
whatever the obstacles.

00:03:35.239 --> 00:03:39.879
We shall try not to fail you.

00:03:40.879 --> 00:03:42.159
Thank you.

